# Build context for docker/Dockerfile. The image builds everything from
# source, so keep local state, secrets, VCS metadata and build output out of it
# (Docker does not read .gitignore).

# VCS and tooling state. Leaving out .git also stops Claude Code / Codex agent
# runs inside the container from branching worktrees off the app's own source.
.git
.agents
.claude
.tmp
.uv-cache
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
.pytest-tmp-*
**/__pycache__
MagicMock
test-temp-v2
media
!media/brand/README.md
import.json
**/*.log

# Env files: a local .env may hold real keys. Only the template ships.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.template

# Keys and credential files (the same patterns .gitignore keeps out).
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json
**/apikeys.json

# Build output and environments; the image rebuilds them.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
.cli-venv
client/dist
server/nodejs/dist
*.tgz

# The Electron shell is not part of the server image.
desktop
!desktop/README.md

# Neither is the product film (a standalone Remotion package with its own
# node_modules, rendered audio and video output).
marketing

# Generated artwork (output/) and local scratch space (tmp/); the image uses
# neither. Both patterns match only at the context root.
output
tmp

# Terraform providers and state (state files carry secrets).
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*
**/*.tfvars*

# Local runtime data, including SQLite's side files and the data dirs a local
# DATA_DIR may point at (data/, the pre-rebrand .machina/). Keep only the
# git-tracked seed workflows.
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
.opencompany/*
!.opencompany/workflows
.machina
data
# A source-dev backend resolves a relative DATA_DIR against its own cwd, so
# the Mobile workspace's phone runtime (emulator images, JDK, engine; several
# GB) can sit under server/.opencompany. The runtime stage copies all of
# server/, so leaving it in would put it in the image.
server/.opencompany
